</li><li>Stone Shower</li><li>Strong Haste</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sudden%20Death\">Sudden Death</a></li><li>Summon Creature</li><li>Summon Druid Familiar</li><li>Summon Knight Familiar</li><li>Summon Monk Familiar</li><li>Summon Paladin Familiar</li><li>Summon Sorcerer Familiar</li><li>Swift Foot</li><li>Thunderstorm</li><li>Train Party</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Healing%20Rune\">Ultimate Healing Rune</a></li><li>Ultimate Light</li><li>Virtue of Harmony</li><li>Virtue of Justice</li><li>Virtue of Sustain</li><li>Wild Growth</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["behemoth-quest"]}